  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "en",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "bei6p0wyrd8t",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Only Here In "
            },
            {
              "_key": "8eng9dbqk7j1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "mayx7deb2jnp"
              ],
              "text": "Ismailia"
            },
            {
              "_key": "0vyhqv8wmjoz",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ": The Pulse of Football in the Heart of Egypt"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "mayx7deb2jnp",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58868",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000006",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "In the heart of Ismailia, a city celebrated for its historical significance and cultural richness, thrives a football team that has captured the imaginations of fans far and wide. Known affectionately as the “Egyptian Brazil team,” this squad has become synonymous with a style of play that mirrors the flair, creativity, and passion of Brazilian football, a testament to their distinctive yellow jerseys that gleam under the "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000003"
              ],
              "text": "Egyptian"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000005",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " sun much like the iconic yellow of Brazil’s national team."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000003",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Egyptian",
              "newTab": true
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000008",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "This team, a beacon of talent within the Egyptian football league, has consistently been a nurturing ground for players who possess an innate ability to dazzle on the field. Their approach to the game is one of artistry and finesse, prioritizing skillful dribbles, precise passes, and a rhythmic tempo that evokes the samba style of their South American counterparts. It’s this commitment to an attractive, attacking brand of football that has endeared them to fans and neutrals alike, making their matches a spectacle of pure footballing joy."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000a",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The “Egyptian Brazil” nickname does more than just highlight the team’s choice of kit or their entertaining style of play; it speaks to a deeper philosophy that football should be joyful, expressive, and, above all, beautiful. This ethos has not only defined the team’s identity but has also inspired a generation of players who come through their ranks, aspiring to emulate the magicians of Brazilian football."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Despite the challenges that come with competing in "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000c"
              ],
              "text": "Egypt’s"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " highly competitive football environment, the team has consistently managed to unearth and develop talents who would go on to shine both domestically and internationally. This success is attributed to a robust youth development program that emphasizes technical skill, tactical understanding, and the psychological aspects of playing attractive football."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/contact-us/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/contact",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000014",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The Egyptian Brazil team’s influence extends beyond the pitch; it’s a source of pride for the city of Ismailia. The team embodies the city’s spirit of resilience, creativity, and beauty, mirroring its enchanting gardens, peaceful lakes, and the historic "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000011"
              ],
              "text": "Suez Canal"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000013",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " that runs through its heart. In many ways, the team is a living testament to Ismailia’s legacy as a place where cultures blend, histories converge, and new narratives are woven, all through the universal language of football."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/suez-travel-guide/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/guide/suez",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001c",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "As they continue to grace the football fields of "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000016"
              ],
              "text": "Egypt"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", the Egyptian Brazil team not only represents Ismailia but also carries the torch for a style of football that prioritizes joy, artistry, and the beautiful game’s inherent beauty. In their yellow shirts, they remind us that football, at its best, is a celebration of skill, passion, and the endless possibilities that emerge when talent and "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000019"
              ],
              "text": "creativity"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " are given free rein on the canvas of the pitch."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/abu-simble-travel-guide/qasr-ibrim/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/guide/abu-simbel/qasr-ibrim",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/luxury-resorts-in-egypt/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/blog/ejiputo-no-ragujuaririzoto-o-do-erabu-ka",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000021",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "cn8awnqpd1e2",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Although there are some decent hotels that can accommodate visitors, most travelers prefer to get an over-day trip from "
            },
            {
              "_key": "q0lxhq7uz3vk",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "mws71gda6igy"
              ],
              "text": "Aswan"
            },
            {
              "_key": "htvl4naulsxw",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " or "
            },
            {
              "_key": "ava2taaly22g",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "ssvqg2dwes62"
              ],
              "text": "Cairo"
            },
            {
              "_key": "fv76w0urs1v3",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " where they spend 3-4 hours to tour the temple of "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000001e"
              ],
              "text": "Abu Simble"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000020",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " which is surely one of the most fabulous wonders of ancient Egypt."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001e",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/abu-simble-travel-guide/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/guide/abu-simbel",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "mws71gda6igy",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58758",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            },
            {
              "_key": "ssvqg2dwes62",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-83284",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000026",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000022",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Constructed in the middle of the 13th century BC, Ramses II, the builder of the two temples and many other important constructions of ancient "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000024",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000023"
              ],
              "text": "Egypt"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000025",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", with this huge structure, he wanted to reflect his greatness to the inhabitants of Nubia and also to document the victory he achieved after defeating the Hittites in the Battle of Qadesh."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000023",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/al-arish-travel-guide/movement-guide/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/guide/al-arish/getting-around-al-arish",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000002e",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000027",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The two rock-cut temples were originally located to the south of the city of "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000029",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000028"
              ],
              "text": "Aswan"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ". However, with the construction of the High Dam in the 1960s, the "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000002b"
              ],
              "text": "Abu Simble Temples"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", together with seven other temples of Nubia had to be relocated."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000028",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/aswan-travel-guide/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/guide/aswan",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002b",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/abu-simble-temples-day-tour/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/abu-simbel-temples-day-tour-from-aswan",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000002f",
          "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/6340271451_54d2407fd3_b.jpg",
          "_type": "image",
          "alt": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "A crane on a barge in a river with a cityscape in the background under a clear blue sky"
            }
          ],
          "caption": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "The interplay of industry and urban life on the river's edge"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000030",
          "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/ismailia_desk.jpg",
          "_type": "image",
          "alt": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Colorful mosaic art installation in the foreground with a lush green park and desert landscape in the background"
            }
          ],
          "caption": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Art meets oasis in this striking juxtaposition of mosaic beauty and arid desert"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "es",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "0b2wod7i2spg",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Pasión de "
            },
            {
              "_key": "m54l7wd4sjy0",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "nbtxtxfe7u34"
              ],
              "text": "Ismailia"
            },
            {
              "_key": "k1p0bhgszp6e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ": El pulso del fútbol en el corazón de Egipto"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "nbtxtxfe7u34",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58868",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000005",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "En el corazón de Ismailia, una ciudad célebre por su importancia histórica y su riqueza cultural, prospera un equipo de fútbol que ha cautivado la imaginación de aficionados de todas partes."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000003",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Conocido cariñosamente como la «selección egipcia de Brasil», este equipo se ha convertido en sinónimo de un estilo de juego que refleja el estilo, la creatividad y la pasión del fútbol brasileño, como atestiguan sus características camisetas amarillas, que brillan bajo el sol egipcio como el icónico amarillo de la selección nacional de Brasil."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000011",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Este equipo, un faro de talento dentro de la liga de fútbol egipcia, ha sido siempre un vivero de jugadores "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000007"
              ],
              "text": "que poseen una"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " habilidad innata para deslumbrar en el campo."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Su enfoque "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000c"
              ],
              "text": "del juego es de arte"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " y delicadeza, dando prioridad a los regates hábiles, los pases precisos y un tempo rítmico que evoca el estilo de samba de sus homólogos sudamericanos."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Es este compromiso con un fútbol atractivo y ofensivo lo que les ha granjeado el cariño de aficionados y neutrales, convirtiendo sus partidos en un espectáculo de pura alegría futbolística."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-de-guiza/la-mastaba-de-ptahshepses-en-abusir/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/guide/guiza/la-mastaba-de-ptahshepses-en-abusir",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-de-el-cairo/el-museo-egipcio/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/guide/cairo/el-museo-egipcio",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "El apodo de «Brasil Egipcio» hace algo más que "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000013"
              ],
              "text": "destacar"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " la elección de la equipación del equipo o su entretenido estilo de juego; habla de una filosofía más profunda, según la cual el fútbol debe ser alegre, expresivo y, sobre todo, bello."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Este ethos no sólo ha definido la identidad del equipo, sino que también ha inspirado a una generación de jugadores "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000018"
              ],
              "text": "que pasan por"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " sus filas, aspirando a emular a los magos del fútbol brasileño."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000013",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-de-suez/destacados/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-de-suez/destacados/",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/7-cosas-inolvidables-que-hacer-en-aswan/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/blog/7-cosas-inolvidables-que-hacer-en-aswan",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000022",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "A pesar de los retos que conlleva competir en el entorno futbolístico altamente competitivo de "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Egipto"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", el equipo ha conseguido sistemáticamente descubrir y desarrollar talentos que llegarían a brillar tanto en el ámbito nacional como internacional."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000020",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000021",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Este éxito se atribuye a un sólido programa de desarrollo juvenil que hace hincapié en la habilidad técnica, la comprensión táctica y los aspectos psicológicos de jugar un fútbol atractivo."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000002b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000023",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "La influencia de la selección egipcia de Brasil va más allá del terreno de juego; es una fuente de orgullo para la ciudad de Ismailia."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000024",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "uxydfez77dzd",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "El equipo encarna el espíritu de resistencia, creatividad y belleza de la ciudad, reflejando sus encantadores jardines, sus apacibles lagos y el histórico Canal de "
            },
            {
              "_key": "fyqeh4f1m99d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "62r9t08oz252"
              ],
              "text": "Suez"
            },
            {
              "_key": "0xs8sszm946d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " que atraviesa su corazón."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000026",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000027",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "En muchos sentidos, el equipo es un testimonio vivo del legado de Ismailia como lugar donde se mezclan "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000029",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000028"
              ],
              "text": "culturas"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", convergen historias y se tejen nuevas narrativas, todo ello a través del lenguaje universal del fútbol."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000028",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/souq-bab-el-louk-el-mercado-fresco-de-el-cairo/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/blog/souq-bab-el-louk-el-mercado-fresco-de-el-cairo",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "62r9t08oz252",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58938",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000032",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000002c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Mientras sigue engalanando los campos de fútbol de Egipto, la selección egipcia de Brasil no sólo representa a Ismailia, sino que también lleva la antorcha de un estilo de fútbol que da prioridad a la alegría, el arte y la belleza inherente al deporte rey."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Con sus camisetas amarillas, nos recuerdan que el fútbol, en su máxima expresión, es una celebración de la habilidad, la pasión y las infinitas posibilidades que surgen cuando se da rienda suelta al talento y la "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000030",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000002f"
              ],
              "text": "creatividad"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000031",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " sobre el lienzo del terreno de juego."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000002f",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/itinerario-definitivo-de-8-dias-por-egipto-un-viaje-en-el-tiempo/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/blog/itinerario-definitivo-de-8-dias-por-egipto-un-viaje-en-el-tiempo",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000037",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "lllth4uufhfa",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Aunque hay algunos hoteles decentes que pueden alojar a los visitantes, la mayoría de los viajeros prefieren hacer una excursión de más de un día desde "
            },
            {
              "_key": "7o6we0okgswy",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "464sv2rib1yi"
              ],
              "text": "Asuán"
            },
            {
              "_key": "mk9rz8mug4tz",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " o "
            },
            {
              "_key": "ttwb6hejd743",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "xn8r3lq56ybn"
              ],
              "text": "El Cairo"
            },
            {
              "_key": "iwa00349ig16",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " en la que dedican 3-4 horas a recorrer el "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000035",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000034"
              ],
              "text": "templo de Abu Simble"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000036",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", que es sin duda una de las maravillas más fabulosas del antiguo Egipto."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000034",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-de-abu-simble/el-gran-templo-de-abu-simble/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/guide/abu-simbel/el-gran-templo-de-abu-simbel",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "464sv2rib1yi",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58758",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            },
            {
              "_key": "xn8r3lq56ybn",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-83284",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000003c",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000038",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Construido a mediados del siglo XIII a.C., Ramsés II, el constructor de los dos templos y de muchas otras construcciones importantes del antiguo Egipto, quiso reflejar con esta enorme estructura su grandeza ante los habitantes de "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000003a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000039"
              ],
              "text": "Nubia"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000003b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " y también documentar la victoria que consiguió tras derrotar a los hititas en la batalla de Qadesh."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000039",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-de-asuan/el-museo-nubio/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/guide/aswan/el-museo-nubio",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000046",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000003d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Los dos templos excavados en la roca estaban situados originalmente al sur de la ciudad de "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000003f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000003e"
              ],
              "text": "Asuán"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000040",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000041",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000042",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Sin embargo, con la construcción de la Gran Presa en la década de 1960, "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000044",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000043"
              ],
              "text": "los Templos de Abu Simble"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000045",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", junto con otros siete templos de Nubia, tuvieron que ser trasladados."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000003e",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-de-asuan/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/guide/asuan",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000043",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/excursion-de-un-dia-a-los-majestuosos-templos-de-abu-simble/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/abu-simbel-temples-day-tour-from-aswan",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "ja",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000000",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "イスマイリアの情熱：エジプトの中心地に息づくフットボールの鼓動"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000003",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "イスマイリアの中心に位置し、その歴史的意義と文化的豊かさで知られるこの街には、国内外のファンを魅了してきたフットボールチームがあります。「エジプトのブラジルチーム」と親しまれるこのチームは、ブラジルのナショナルチームを彷彿とさせる華やかさと創造性に富んだプレースタイルで知られ、その象徴である黄色いユニフォームがエジプトの太陽の下で輝く姿は、まさにブラジルの伝説的なチームのそれを想起させます。"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000005",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "このチームはエジプトのサッカーリーグの中で才能の灯台として機能しており、フィールドで観客を魅了する自然な才能を持った選手を常に輩出しています。そのプレースタイルは芸術性と洗練さに溢れており、巧みなドリブル、正確なパス、南米のサンバスタイルを彷彿とさせるリズミカルなテンポを重視しています。この美しく、攻撃的なサッカースタイルへのこだわりが、彼らをファンや中立の観客にも愛される理由であり、その試合は純粋なサッカーの喜びを体感できるスペクタクルといえます。"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000007",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "「エジプトのブラジル」という愛称は、単にユニフォームやプレースタイルを指しているだけでなく、サッカーは楽しく、表現力豊かで、美しくあるべきだという深い哲学を反映しています。この哲学はチームのアイデンティティを形成し、ブラジルのフットボール魔術師たちを目標とする次世代の選手たちに影響を与えています。"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000009",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "エジプトの厳しいサッカー環境で競う中、チームは国内外で輝く選手を次々と発掘・育成してきました。この成功の背後には、技術的スキル、戦術的理解、そして魅力的なサッカーをプレーする心理的側面を重視する堅固な若手育成プログラムがあります。"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "エジプトのブラジルチームの影響はピッチの外にも広がり、イスマイリアの誇りの源となっています。このチームは、イスマイリアのレジリエンス、創造性、美しさを体現しており、その姿は街の魅力的な庭園、穏やかな湖、そして街の中心を流れる歴史的なスエズ運河に共鳴しています。ある意味、このチームは文化が交差し、歴史が交わり、新たな物語がサッカーという普遍的な言語を通して紡がれる場所としてのイスマイリアの遺産を体現しているといえます。"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "エジプトのフィールドでその勇姿を見せ続ける中、このチームはイスマイリアを代表するだけでなく、喜び、芸術性、美しさを追求するサッカースタイルの象徴として、輝きを放っています。彼らの黄色いユニフォームは、サッカーが最高の形で展開されるとき、それがスキル、情熱、創造力に満ち溢れた美しいゲームであることを思い出させてくれる存在です。"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
